title: "Calibrated to the Headline: Two Prints and the Path That Moved Between Them"
abstract: "In June 2026 the 2-year Treasury yield was repriced four times in four weeks, from 4.13% to a 4.24% peak and back to 4.14%, driven as much by re-estimates of the committee as by news about the economy."
